[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8162.149, "timestamp": "02:16:02", "text": "我也有這種感覺。我下午3點醒了。  情緒。  讓我們一起加入巷戰吧！當然。  當然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8166.629, "timestamp": "02:16:06", "text": "看起來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8171.109, "timestamp": "02:16:11", "text": "可能是[音樂]等等，我該施什麼咒語來著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8171.51, "timestamp": "02:16:11", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8177.35, "timestamp": "02:16:17", "text": "哦，對了，復活"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8179.43, "timestamp": "02:16:19", "text": "。但是你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8185.75, "timestamp": "02:16:25", "text": "需要取消準備一個法術，因為你已經準備好了全部九個法術。  復甦。在哪裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8189.589, "timestamp": "02:16:29", "text": "？  你可以用一樣東西交換另一樣東西。  哦，不錯。哦，我可以搜尋。嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8190.31, "timestamp": "02:16:30", "text": "謝謝。那裡。就是這個名字。  被蜱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8201.03, "timestamp": "02:16:41", "text": "蟲叮咬了。  哦，我得處理掉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8206.07, "timestamp": "02:16:46", "text": "一個。  哦，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8209.03, "timestamp": "02:16:49", "text": "的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8212.79, "timestamp": "02:16:52", "text": "點擊。哦，是的。你想點擊它嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8214.549, "timestamp": "02:16:54", "text": "點擊它。對不起。"}]